      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FEDERAL EMERAN (4) boasts a strong record this course with two wins and three minors from six tries. Recorded a 2.5 lengths win (30.09) in a Mix 5 last time at this track. With a clean break looks hard to beat. LUMBY (1) turned spotting a big start finishing fifth (30.65) last time in a Mix 5 at this track. Solid record at the distance winning three races. Deserves plenty of respect. FIVE BIRDIES (2) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by a nose at this track in a handy 30.28 beating Professor Nessa. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and three minor placings to her credit. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. KITTY ANN (3) will be hard to beat with a drop in journey.",
